{"text":"{
  "status": "STABLE",
  "core_findings": [
    "Sampled training positives outrank negatives in 96.64–99.33% of valid positions across all four categories (10 batches/category; 10,317–15,963 positions). These position-weighted descriptive results establish strong sampled training separation, not held-out ranking quality; uncertainty intervals are not supplied.",
    "Representations retain substantial variation: unit-normalized item effective ranks are 33.96–50.21, and endpoint ranks are 18.21–29.22 across 200 eligible training users/category, with no reported exclusions. Identity and batch-reordering checks have zero differences in every category; these controls and covariance summaries do not establish useful ranking."
  ],
  "key_implications": [
    "The model consistently separates observed training pairs under the sampled negative difficulty; large raw margins remain score-scale dependent.",
    "Held-out performance remains unavailable: validation interventions and verified local scorer/loss panels are null, while omitted sensitivity and candidate-depth results cannot support temporal or generalization conclusions."
  ],
  "evidence": {
    "headline_metrics": {
      "pairwise_accuracy_Movies_Industrial_Electronics_CDs": [0.99020, 0.97192, 0.96637, 0.99330],
      "valid_training_positions_Movies_Industrial_Electronics_CDs": [11841, 11076, 10317, 15963],
      "item_unit_normalized_effective_rank_range": [33.9561, 50.2143],
      "intact_user_endpoint_unit_normalized_effective_rank_range": [18.2129, 29.2200],
      "identity_and_batch_reordering_max_difference": 0.0
    },
    "brief_metric_read": {
      "pairwise_accuracy": "Strong separation conditional on sampled negatives; positions are not independent users.",
      "effective_rank": "Variation across multiple directions; not a relevance or ranking metric.",
      "checks": "Reported identity and batch-order controls pass in evaluation mode.",
      "missing_evidence": "No held-out HR@10 or defensible four-category validation macro result is supplied."
    }
  }
}"}
